      "model": "tally_board",
      "codex": "wizards_tally",
      "text": "A board of old oak, notched once for every year, a hundred and more of them. Above the notches someone has carved: ONE CASK EACH YEAR, FOR THE WIZARD, WHEN HE COMES. Below, in a newer hand: he hasn't. Keep notching."
    },
