      "label": "A letter pinned with a thorn",
      "model": "letter",
      "codex": "ruxandra_letter",
      "text": "Kostin. The last stone is in that house. Pull up every board, empty every cask. The Lord-in-the-Land has been patient with the bird-people long enough. When the effigy wakes it will walk east to the vines and finish what you could not. Be gone from there by then. R."
